WEBVTT

00:29:56.167 --> 00:30:00.018
The other one would sit,
study everybody else falling,

00:30:00.042 --> 00:30:03.059
and then when he understood
what not to do, then he would go.

00:30:03.083 --> 00:30:04.976
And I just thought, this is for life.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:08.226
One is the risk taker,
one is the risk manager.

00:30:08.250 --> 00:30:09.518
AG: Yeah.

00:30:09.542 --> 00:30:13.934
EP: And both will create
experiences of trust and risk.

00:30:13.958 --> 00:30:15.934
AG: Yeah, no, I think that's interesting.

00:30:15.958 --> 00:30:21.559
I guess what I'm stuck on is
you didn't like my expectation

00:30:21.583 --> 00:30:24.601
that I could have the power
to build trust, but I think --

00:30:24.625 --> 00:30:27.559
EP: I think it's beautiful,
I think it's a beautiful wish.

00:30:27.583 --> 00:30:29.809
AG: You definitely
didn't describe it that way

00:30:29.833 --> 00:30:32.101
when you made fun of me
for liking comic books.